  "question": {
    "text": "If the difference between the number of subsets of two sets <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn></math>, then <math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
