  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math><br />Given,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math>"
